<doc id="5172" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=5172" title="Taman Safari Indonésia">
Taman Safari Indonésia

Taman Safari Indonésia mangrupa tempat &lt;a href="pelesir"&gt;pelesir&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kulawarga"&gt;kulawarga&lt;/a&gt; nu eusina sasatoan aya di Désa Cibeureum, &lt;a href="Cisarua%2C%20Bogor"&gt;Kacamatan Cisarua&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabupat%C3%A9n%20Bogor"&gt;Kabupatén Bogor&lt;/a&gt;. Status pangawasaan tanah aya dina wewenang &lt;a href="Yayasan%20Taman%20Safari"&gt;Yayasan Taman Safari&lt;/a&gt; nu mibanda tur ngokolakeun ieu obyék wisata.
<h2>Perenah</h2>
Perenah.
Taman Safari Indonésia perenahna di jalur antara &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jawa%20Barat"&gt;Jawa Barat&lt;/a&gt; nu ngaliwatan Puncak. Lamun maké mobil, kurang leuwih 80&amp;nbsp;km ti &lt;a href="Bandara%20Internasional%20Soekarno%20Hatta"&gt;Bandara Internasional Soekarno Hatta&lt;/a&gt;, kurang leuwih 1.5 – 2 jam perjalanan maké mobil. Ti Bandung mah, kurang leuwih 78&amp;nbsp;km atawa 3 jam maké mobil. Lamun maké kendaraan umum ti Jakarta atawa Bandung, urang bisa eureun di pertelon Cisarua/Safari, tuluy maké ojeg atawa angkot.
<h2>Sasatoan jeung tutuwuhan</h2>
<h3>Sasatoan</h3>
Sasatoan jeung tutuwuhan.
Sasatoan.
Loba sasatoan nu aya di Taman Safari, di antarana:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Mamalia"&gt;Mamalia&lt;/a&gt;: Acinonyx jubatus, Aepyceros melampus, Ammotragus lervia, Antilope cervicapra, Arctictis binturong, Axis axis, Babyrousa babyrussa, Bison bonasus, Boselaphus tragocamelus, Bubalus depressicornis, Singa laut Californianus, Camelus bactrianus, Camelus dromedarius, Ceratotherium simum, Cervus unicolor, Connochaetes taurinus, Dendrolagus matschiei, Elephas maximus, Equus burchellii, Equus grevyi, Giraffa camelopardalis, Helarctos malayanus, Hylobates klossii, &lt;a href="badak%20Sunda"&gt;badak Sunda&lt;/a&gt; (Rhinoceros sondaicus), Léopard, Muntiacus muntjak, Nasalis larvatus, singa (Panthera léo), maung (Panthera Tigris), Pongo pygmaeus, &lt;a href="tapir"&gt;tapir&lt;/a&gt; (Tapirus indicus), &lt;a href="macan%20bodas"&gt;macan bodas&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Reptil: Blue tongue, Boa constrictor, Crocodylus porosus, Frilled Lizard, Morelia viridis green tree, Ophiophagus hannah, Python reticulatus, Varanus komodoensis, Varanus salvato</li>
<li>Manuk: Anthropoides virgo, Ara macao, Pelecanus onocrotalus, &lt;a href="kakatua"&gt;kakatua&lt;/a&gt; (Cacatua alba)</li>
