<dt>&lt;a href="Imam"&gt;Imam&lt;/a&gt; (إمام): literally, léader; e.g. a man who leads a community or leads the prayer; the &lt;a href="Shi%27a"&gt;Shi'a&lt;/a&gt; sect use the term only as a title for one of the twelve God-appointed successors of Prophet Muhammad.</dt>
