<li>&lt;a href="Butuh%2C%20Purworejo"&gt;Kecamatan Butuh&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Gebang%2C%20Purworejo"&gt;Kacamatan Gebang&lt;/a&gt;</li>
